cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Outer loop: a synthetic benchmark for ranking-weight search"
message: If you use this benchmark, please cite the repository and PREREGISTRATION.md.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hammadi
    given-names: Ramsis
date-released: "2026-09-05"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/REPLACE_ME/outer-loop"
abstract: >-
  Standalone synthetic benchmark of the outer loop that tunes ranking weights
  (score = w · p̂) under a fixed user-day budget. Pre-registered confirmatory
  comparison of a fitted GP simulator against delayed-retention A/B labels.
